### for every new call

### 1. get the service document
http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CatalogService
Authorization: Basic varun:1234
### 2. get the service metadata - skeleton of service
http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CatalogService/$metadata
Authorization: Basic yamini:4321

### 2. GET - fetch all employee records
http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CatalogService/EmployeeSet
Authorization: Basic varun:1234

### 3. $count GET employee count
http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CatalogService/EmployeeSet/$count


### 4. single employee record by key
http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CatalogService/EmployeeSet(ID='02BD2137-0890-1EEA-A6C2-BB55C197C7FB')

### 5. pagination - $top & $skip  employee set
http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CatalogService/EmployeeSet?$top=2&skip=2

### 6. filter - simple employee set
http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CatalogService/EmployeeSet?$filter=bankName eq 'My Bank of San Francisco'

### 7. filter - like operator  employee set
http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CatalogService/EmployeeSet?$filter=contains(nameFirst,'Su')


### 8. get ALL  purchase order set
http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CatalogService/PurchaseOrderSet

### 9. get ONE  purchase order by key
http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CatalogService/PurchaseOrderSet/02BD2137-0890-1EEA-A6C2-BB55C1979001

### 10. get ONE  purchase order by key & items - lazy loading
http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CatalogService/PurchaseOrderSet/02BD2137-0890-1EEA-A6C2-BB55C1979001?$expand=Items

### 11. get ALL  purchase order  & ALL items 
http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CatalogService/PurchaseOrderSet?$expand=Items

### 12. filter - lamda function ( all || any )  purchase order set
http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CatalogService/PurchaseOrderSet?$expand=Items&$filter=Items/all(wa:wa/GROSS_AMOUNT gt 5000)

### 13. POST - create employee data
POST http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CatalogService/EmployeeSet
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic yamini:4321

{
    "nameFirst": "Lionel",
    "nameMiddle": null,
    "nameLast": "Messi",
    "nameInitials": null,
    "sex": "M",
    "language": "E",
    "phoneNumber": "+1 224 374 529",
    "email": "lionel.messi@gmail.com",
    "loginName": "MESSIL",
    "Currency_code": "EUR",
    "salaryAmount": "0",
    "accountNumber": "111222333",
    "bankId": "510000655",
    "bankName": "RBS",
    "country": null
}

### 14. PATCH - update employee data
PATCH  http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CatalogService/EmployeeSet/0c8872ec-3916-4878-a241-d50aa50b2d44
Content-Type: application/json

{
 "salaryAmount": "1000000.00"
}

### 15. DELETE - delete employee data
DELETE http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CatalogService/EmployeeSet/0c8872ec-3916-4878-a241-d50aa50b2d44




### 16. CDS Service
GET  http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CDSService

### 17. CDS Service - Product View
GET  http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CDSService/ProductSet

