GET  http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CDSService/ProductSet/74867AD200E41EDBA5D8B06B26EB6052

### 19. CDS Service - dependent data - lazy loading
GET  http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CDSService/ProductSet/74867AD200E41EDBA5D8B06B26EB6052?$expand=To_Items

### 19. CDS Service - Partner Set dependent data - lazy loading
GET  http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CDSService/PartnerSet/74867AD200E41EDBA5D8B06885A56052


### 20. action ~ boost purchase order by key
POST http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CatalogService/PurchaseOrderSet/02BD2137-0890-1EEA-A6C2-BB55C1979001/boost
Content-Type: application/json

{} 

### 21. function ~ top3 most expensive purchase order by key
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CatalogService/getMostExpOrders(top=1)


 
